{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16446","headline":"胡笳十八拍 第七拍 · 刘商","name":"胡笳十八拍 第七拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"男儿妇人带弓箭，塞马蕃羊卧霜霰。\n寸步东西岂自由，偷生乞死非情愿。\n龟兹觱篥愁中听，碎叶琵琶夜深怨。\n竟夕无云月上天，故乡应得重相见。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16446.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16446","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}